[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 540.31, "timestamp": "00:09:00", "text": "但這真的非常罕見，很難找到。現在在虛擬主播圈就是這樣，要嘛你得放棄之前的智慧財產權，然後去公司或機構工作；要嘛"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 546.63, "timestamp": "00:09:06", "text": "你運氣好，被星探發掘，進入一家能支持你個人夢想的公司，像是學習商標之類的。對，商標這方面的東西，在印度註冊商標真的很貴，一個"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 550.941, "timestamp": "00:09:10", "author": "@yourciplaaa", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/d04G7qrIFuOqZEMQoYtfNyP24imug7Ol2kep0R0jrLq6oablNYJPp4EtD_v3t1YQ5FBJWRqazP8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Haii"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 571.583, "timestamp": "00:09:31", "author": "@joqnix", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/1rNe-FcvCKbSXpzuK86tx4EpeshYhox1KGRLnP8jvk1YWjbcndAtJwbDs74VZeGf462RnXuCJPE=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hewwo @ini xyvra "}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 583.15, "timestamp": "00:09:43", "text": "商標名或品牌就要十萬盧比左右，我真沒想到這麼貴。"}]